WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
I saw on Qilin Xuanxiao's forum that you guys went into the mountains.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,240
But what’s going on with these pictures?

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,560
How could it be so embarrassing?

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,720
Isn't it said that the number one Xuan Xiao in the Federation is the one who cripples others?

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,920
Qilin's strength is so high, can you do it?

6
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,320
Otherwise, come back

7
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:14,560
Isn't this how Xia Yu looked when I was sitting in the cave watching the rain in a daze that day?

8
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:24,930
So that guy named Cao bullied you?

9
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:27,490
Did you know that the federal government has a hotline for education complaints? Let me tell you.

10
00:00:27,490 --> 00:00:29,980
Some people just hate the rich

11
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:32,340
He just thinks your sister and I have a lot of talent

12
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:56,890
involving personal assault

13
00:00:56,890 --> 00:00:57,850
network rupture
